1, "tname": "科学科普", "copyright": 3, "pic": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/71779c449de371ca124aebaece10c0c9540f9fb5.jpg", "title": "超级暴雨来了：台风红霞将巅峰登陆广东，四川等省高温将明显缓解", "pubdate": 1784992311, "ctime": 1784992311, "desc": "7月25日傍晚，珠三角大部突然黑云遮天、狂风暴雨大作，广州南沙最大阵风达到了13级，和一般台风无异，香港昂坪山顶上的自动气象站被狂风吹坏，江门新会区还发布了龙卷警报。有人问这是台风红霞提前到了吗？其实不然，这不是台风红霞的本体，而是台风红霞外围的台前飑线。最新的风云4C闪电云图可见，这条飑线上闪电极其密集，显示对流活动极强。这条飑线之所以如此强大，一来是因为台风红霞在迅速加强，台风能量在向外扩散；另一方面，受副热带高压和台风红霞外围下沉气流影响，7月25日广东各地极其炎热，地面和近地面大气被烤的滚烫，积攒", "state": 0, "duration": 211, "mission_id": 4065027, "rights": {"bp": 0, "elec": 0, "download": 0, "movie": 0, "pay": 0, "hd5": 0, "no_reprint": 0, "autoplay": 1, "ugc_pay": 0, "is_cooperation": 0, "ugc_pay_preview": 0, "no_background": 0, "arc_pay": 0, "pay_free_watch": 0}, "owner": {"mid": 547072854, "name": "中气爱", "face": "https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/face/e5f6be30a18988ed92f677e6a47a346270172081.jpg"}, "stat": {"aid": 116981235848306, "view": 445656, "danmaku": 1276, "reply": 4606, "favorite": 1361, "coin": 906, "share": 3495, "now_rank": 0, "his_rank": 0, "like": 19866, "dislike": 0, "vt": 0, "vv": 445656, "fav_g": 1, "like_g": 0}, "dynamic": "", "cid": 40293960913, "dimension": {"width": 1920, "height": 1080, "rotate": 0}, "short_link_v2": "https://b23.tv/BV1DN3G6mEoL", "first_frame": "http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/storyff/_00001bjn67cqmo9yh2chd41plcaag4b_firsti.jpg", "pub_location": "江苏", "cover43": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8dd25cd07ff5d8546671e4bd3bbdb42c66335f1d.jpg", "tidv2": 2207, "tnamev2": "随拍·综合", "pid_v2": 1032, "pid_name_v2": "其他", "bvid": "BV1DN3G6mEoL", "season_type": 0, "is_ogv": false, "ogv_info": null, "enable_vt": 0, "ai_rcmd": null, "rcmd_reason": {"content": "", "corner_mark": 0}}, {"aid": 116971253274492, "videos": 1, "tid": 21, "tname": "日常", "copyright": 1, "pic": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e69e20b838bbad5e2ece2b2c6be554fe005f6d0a.jpg", "title": "《下一个是谁》第七季（2）", "pubdate": 1784865600, "ctime": 1784839804, "desc": "《下一个是谁》第七季来啦！！\n每期都会抽一台iPhone17 Pro！每期抽奖去主投up主（@自来卷三木  